      "note": [
        "The denominator GDP refer to GDP published 28/11/2025.",
        "Comment: Liabilities of units involved in financial activities – includes mainly NACE 64. \r\n Financial service activities, except for Central Bank. \r\n  NACE 65 Insurance activities, NACE 66 activities auxiliary to financial services. \r\n  The aggregates include only corporations reporting liabilities higher than 0.01% of GDP, and no corporations classified within general government. \r\n   Sub-sector State do not exist in Sweden. \r\n  Figures for Social security funds is included together with Central government for year 2013, i.e. not possible to split.",
        "Under News there is a [methodological description](https://www.scb.se/nr0111-en)."
